&lt;h3 data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the Team &amp;amp; Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik&#39;s Product Line Sales organisation drives focused growth across Rubrik&#39;s specialised workloads, including our SaaS data protection and security portfolio (Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, Salesforce and other critical SaaS applications). This team partners closely with core Account Executives, Sales Engineers and Customer Success to bring deep product and technical expertise into every SaaS opportunity, from first conversation through technical validation to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a SaaS Product Line Sales Specialist to own and accelerate Rubrik&#39;s SaaS data protection business across Germany, Austria and Switzerland (DACH). This is a highly technical, quota-carrying overlay role: you&#39;ll be the subject-matter expert who can go deep on tenant architecture, identity and access models, backup and recovery mechanics, and the shared responsibility model, and use that fluency to win deals against SaaS-native point solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the SaaS product line number: partner with core Account Executives to identify, qualify and close SaaS data protection and security opportunities across net-new and existing accounts in DACH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with technical credibility: articulate Rubrik&#39;s SaaS architecture, security posture, and the gaps in Microsoft&#39;s and Google&#39;s native shared responsibility model in a way that resonates with both technical and business buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical discovery and validation: run or co-lead discovery calls, demos and proof-of-concept engagements for M365, Google Workspace and Salesforce workloads alongside Sales Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win competitive deals: build and defend positioning against SaaS-native point solutions and other competitors, translating technical differentiation into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build territory and account plans: develop a coverage strategy in partnership with core sales, SE and channel teams to maximise SaaS attach and expansion within the install base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage multiple stakeholders: present to IT administrators, security and compliance teams, and executive economic buyers, tailoring the message to each audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast with discipline: maintain accurate pipeline and forecast data in Salesforce and participate in regular business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current: maintain deep knowledge of Rubrik&#39;s SaaS roadmap, the M365, Google Workspace and Salesforce ecosystems, and the competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-lfile-container=&quot;b6691f93-9ae2-494a-93b0-4dbe41437188&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS sales experience: 3+ years of quota-carrying sales experience selling SaaS data protection, security or governance solutions for Microsoft 365, Google Workspace or Salesforce environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine technical depth: comfortable discussing tenant architecture, APIs, identity and access management (Entra ID/Azure AD), backup and recovery mechanics, and security and compliance frameworks without relying solely on a Sales Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical selling motion: a track record of running or co-leading technical discovery and proof-of-concept engagements, not just handing off to a technical resource.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative approach: comfortable navigating complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles across IT, security and executive buyers in mid-market and enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overlay/specialist experience: prior success working in a platform-selling model alongside core Account Executives, Sales Engineers and Customer Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record: consistent history of quota attainment and strong pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language: professional fluency in German and English, written and spoken, to engage technical and executive buyers across DACH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Microsoft 365 administration, Entra ID/Azure AD or Salesforce administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a data security or resiliency platform that spans SaaS, cloud and on-premises workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with IT, security or compliance buyers in target accounts across DACH.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-remote #LI-CH2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will build software that runs on real drones. You will take Auterion’s platform into a specific customer program and make it work on their hardware, for their mission, in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a software engineering role. You will design, write, integrate and debug C++ and Python code on a Linux-based autonomy stack, working with AuterionOS, our operating system for autonomous vehicles, and Skynode, our flight and mission computer running PX4 and AuterionOS. Your work will span autonomy, computer vision, video streaming and long-range radio links, on partner platforms across aerial, maritime and ground vehicles. What sets this role apart is that your work isn’t finished when the code is merged; it’s finished when the system flies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a forward deployed team dedicated to a single customer program, which owns the outcome from first requirement to deployed system. You will work directly with partners and customers, as well as with Auterion’s core platform, hardware and flight test teams. Between trips, you will work from our Munich office, both at your desk and on the bench.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No drone experience is required. If you have integrated software on cars, robots, industrial machines or other embedded systems, you already have the right foundation, and we will teach you the drone side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement software for customer programs on AuterionOS and Skynode, including features, integrations, payload and sensor drivers, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring up complete systems on real hardware, including compute, sensors, payloads and radios, and get them working end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug across the full stack, determining whether an issue stems from software, configuration, hardware or RF, and then resolving it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer mission requirements into technical solutions and working demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on site with partners and customers to run flight tests, trials and demonstrations, solving problems directly in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy software releases to customer systems, including flashing, configuration and calibration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report field learnings back to core engineering in a form they can act on, and help shape the product roadmap with real customer input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document what you build so that future teams can repeat it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Software, Electrical, Robotics or Aerospace Engineering, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience developing software in modern C++, plus Python for tooling, automation and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux skills, including the command line, logs, Docker and networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience getting software running on embedded or physical systems, including comfort with UART, CAN, I2C and SPI, wiring, and using a multimeter on the bench&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to debugging and the ability to stay methodical under time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English with customers, operators and engineers alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for German security clearance (Sicherheitsüberprüfung)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink or QGroundControl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video pipelines, computer vision, or radio and datalink systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration or field engineering experience in automotive, robotics or aerospace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;The role:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Infrastructure Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Milton Keynes - Hybrid 2 days per week&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Head of IT Service and Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;We are seeking a hands-on and experienced Infrastructure Engineering Manager to join our growing IT team. This role is central to the evolution and operational performance of our infrastructure estate, ensuring it remains secure, resilient, scalable, and aligned to business needs.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll play a key role in shaping and delivering infrastructure strategy across cloud, core enterprise platforms, connectivity, and end-user environments, with a strong focus on technical direction, platform improvement, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who is comfortable providing technical leadership, supporting delivery teams, leading operational improvements, and engaging with senior stakeholders across both technology and the wider business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;As part of a multi-skilled technology function, you will work closely with Product Managers and Delivery Managers to shape priorities, support OKRs, and ensure successful delivery of both strategic change and BAU activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1364&quot;&gt;This is a key role with significant influence on the future direction of our technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt; ·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1400&quot; data-end=&quot;1719&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1400&quot; data-end=&quot;1442&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the ongoing development, standardisation, and modernisation of our corporate infrastructure estate across cloud and enterprise platforms. Contribute to solution design, problem solving, automation, platform improvement, and the resolution of complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1755&quot;&gt;Cloud and platform management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the effective adoption and operation of our cloud platforms and related infrastructure services, ensuring solutions are robust, well-governed, and operationally sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Own operational performance and BAU delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure the effective day-to-day operation of infrastructure services, including monitoring, patching, lifecycle management, incident response, continuity, and continual service improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2402&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2216&quot;&gt;Drive delivery and prioritisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers and Delivery Managers to shape OKRs, prioritise work, and deliver infrastructure change, projects, and service improvements alongside BAU commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2639&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2447&quot;&gt;Stakeholder engagement and translation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships across technology and the business, translating technical issues, risks, and opportunities into clear, practical language for non-technical and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2641&quot; data-end=&quot;2840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2641&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Improve engineering practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the development of standards, automation, and modern ways of working to improve consistency, efficiency, and quality across the infrastructure estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2886&quot; data-end=&quot;2998&quot;&gt;Significant experience in IT infrastructure, spanning cloud, networking, and modern secure access technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3000&quot; data-end=&quot;3134&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in Microsoft Azure, including infrastructure services, networking, identity, governance, and operational management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3136&quot; data-end=&quot;3258&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with automation and infrastructure-as-code tooling such as Terraform, Ansible, and PowerShell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3260&quot; data-end=&quot;3411&quot;&gt;Experience working in or supporting high-performing infrastructure teams, contributing to technical direction and delivery in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of infrastructure security, hardening, monitoring, resilience, compliance, and operational best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3542&quot; data-end=&quot;3657&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to communicate effectively with stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3659&quot; data-end=&quot;3798&quot;&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to take ownership of complex infrastructure challenges from design through to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3800&quot; data-end=&quot;3899&quot;&gt;The ability to adapt to a rapidly changing environment and manage multiple priorities effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of hands-on infrastructure engineering and technical leadership in complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of both cloud and enterprise infrastructure, including servers, networking, identity, storage, and modern device management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience of infrastructure modernisation, particularly in Microsoft Azure-led environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing strategic change, operational improvement, and BAU service ownership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of IT security practices and experience working alongside security teams to ensure infrastructure is resilient and compliant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead across a broad technology remit, operating effectively in Agile ways of working while remaining delivery-focused and outcome-driven&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to translate between technical and non-technical stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style, with the ability to develop people, build trust, and drive high standards across the team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on approach to infrastructure engineering, with an emphasis on operational efficiency and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rightmove, we believe software and product are ultimately people problems, and everything we build aims to improve the lives of others. We see AI as a helpful way to create more space for the human side of our work, from understanding real needs to making sure we are solving the right problems in the right way. There is an expectation that you are proactive in exploring how AI can support your own workflow and productivity, and that you approach it with curiosity and an open mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
