&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Team Lead of Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics, Bot Prevention&lt;/strong&gt;, you will help shape the systems that protect millions of Vinted members from malicious automated traffic and emerging bot threats across our entire marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead a dedicated team of 3 Decision and Data Scientists embedded within the Bot Prevention product team and act as the core Analytics lead within the team’s EPA leadership (Engineering, Product, Analytics). Your team’s scope spans every endpoint across Vinted, covering all forms of marketplace automation, with a strong focus on automated listing creation, sniping, and the rapidly evolving agentic AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bot prevention at Vinted is not about blocking everything automated; it begins with building a deep understanding of all automated activity on the platform and deliberately identifying where automation creates harm. You and your team will take ownership from problem definition through to detection and restriction: discovering hard technical and behavioural signals, developing reusable models and data sources that other teams across Vinted can leverage, and evaluating policy and product interventions through rigorous experimentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity for a senior individual contributor (with a background in Decision Science or Data Science) who is excited to step into people leadership for the first time, while remaining hands-on with complex data problems, signal discovery, and machine learning models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead within EPA: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with your Product Manager and Engineering Manager to shape the team’s roadmap, prioritize initiatives, and own our Key Results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow your team:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and mentor 3 Decision and Data Scientists, helping them prioritize high-impact work, remove blockers, and grow their careers at Vinted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steer the problem space:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide your team in mapping automated traffic across Vinted, defining which automation creates harm, and deciding where and how to intervene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive signal discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead your team in finding hard technical and behavioural signals across all endpoints to reliably separate bot activity from real members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build company-wide data &amp;amp; ML assets:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the creation of shared signals and detection models that can be reused by other teams fighting automation across Vinted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee experimentation &amp;amp; trade-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure your team designs sound experiments and metrics, balancing bot restrictions against false positives and friction for good members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the craft bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold high standards for code review, model validation, data quality, and documentation across both data and decision science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay hands-on where needed&lt;/strong&gt;: Contribute to analyses, support experiment design, review model architectures, and help unblock complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited to step into people leadership and grow others, even if this would be your first formal management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in analytics, experimentation, and product decision-making, with enough machine learning expertise to guide Data Scientists and review their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to turn ambiguous business or product questions into clear analytical approaches and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working in cross-functional teams and influencing decisions across a range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly and can explain complex topics in a simple, structured, and persuasive way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re hands-on enough to review work, challenge assumptions, and support the team on difficult analytical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong skills in SQL and Python, and you’re comfortable working with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fluent in English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted&#39;s business has grown roughly 50% a year, and our infrastructure has to be ready for 10x today&#39;s transaction volume by 2030. It means modernizing how we build, provision, and run infrastructure, with automation and self-service replacing tickets and manual work. We need a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. TPM&lt;/strong&gt; to own the program that makes it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The 10x Scale program starts in Foundations, the domain that runs Vinted&#39;s data centers, compute, traffic routing, and cloud. It spans hardware and network provisioning, Kubernetes lifecycle automation, hybrid on-prem and cloud clusters, persistent workloads on Kubernetes, network capacity across data centers, and workload rightsizing. Scope is expanding: reaching 10x also depends on Platform, Security, and the product domains whose services run on this infrastructure. You&#39;ll be the person who connects all of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want a multi-year program with real technical depth, hard numbers, and visibility at engineering leadership level, this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Infrastructure for 10x scale program end to end: turn the target state into a multi-year roadmap with milestones, owners, and outcome metrics, and keep it current as the business and architecture evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a portfolio of 15+ initiatives across compute, data center, network, cloud and other teams, managing the dependencies between them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the program beyond Foundations: bring Platform, Security, and product domains into scope, agree what each must deliver, and make those commitments visible in their own plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the measurement layer: baseline and track provisioning lead time, share of requests fulfilled without manual work, cluster utilization, cost per transaction, and SLO attainment, and use them to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption on the consumer side: workload migrations to Kubernetes (including databases, Kafka, and other stateful services), rightsizing and autoscaling, migrating tools to cloud, move from tickets to self-service APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the long-lead work: hardware and network purchases, vendor and data center timelines, and the budget that goes with them, so capacity lands before demand does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the program rhythm: weekly sync, planning, monthly business reviews, risk registers, and clear escalation of trade-offs to engineering leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the single source of truth on program status for engineering leadership and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in technical program management, with a proven track record of leading large-scale, cross-functional infrastructure programs end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in SRE, infrastructure, or platform engineering, or engineering management in those areas, that gives you real technical credibility with the teams you&#39;ll work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, or a similar discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of compute, network infrastructure, data center and public cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine bias for outcomes over outputs: you set success metrics before you start and measure consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running programs that mix software delivery with infrastructure and physical-world lead times: hardware procurement, vendor contracts, data center buildout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to drive accountability across teams and domains without direct authority, including at director and engineering leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading in ambiguity and building the playbook as scope grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication for both engineers and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
