&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all highly qualified candidates to apply, as exceptional experience and skills may offer opportunities for flexibility beyond the advertised role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€92.200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€135.600 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Analytics Engineer in the Protect &amp;amp; Support area, you will be responsible for building and maintaining the data models that help keep Vinted safe and trustworthy for millions of users. Our centralized team of Analytics Engineers supports three domains: Trust (preventing scams, counterfeits, illegal listings, and harmful behavior), Security (detecting and stopping bad actors as they register, log in, or abuse the platform), and Frontend Technologies (reporting and experimenting on platform improvements, in close work with Frontend Engineers and Engineering Managers from many different teams). You&#39;ll report to the Analytics Engineering team lead responsible for the area, and join four Senior Analytics Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll learn from an experienced team with a proven track record on complex sources, strict compliance requirements, and data used across the company, such as user information. We work with many interesting product teams, and we turn their complex data into an analytics product that is intuitive for both human and agentic stakeholders. Day to day, you&#39;ll collaborate with Decision and Data Scientists, and with backend and frontend engineers as they move data sources from the legacy system to dedicated backend services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits &lt;strong&gt;at the start of the IC2 level&lt;/strong&gt;. We welcome people already working in data (decision or data science, BI, data engineering) who want to move into analytics engineering, and we&#39;ll teach you the parts of our stack you haven&#39;t used yet. Code reviews and pairing with senior teammates are a regular part of how you&#39;ll learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dbt models for the Trust, Security, and Frontend Technologies domains, following our dimensional modeling and naming conventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Model new data sources as backend services take over from the legacy core system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Turn complex product data into models that people and AI agents can use with confidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monitor data quality and freshness, and fix issues in the data our team owns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write tests and documentation for the tables you ship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with Decision Scientists and engineering teams to understand what they need from the data and turn it into reliable models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Help Data Scientists create features for the machine learning models that detect and stop bad actors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take part in code review, both giving and receiving it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Estimate your work and keep the people who depend on it up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Share what you learn with the team and the wider analytics engineering guild&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficiency: proficient in writing and debugging complex queries using joins, window functions, and CTEs. Familiarity with any SQL dialect is welcome, and experience with BigQuery is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the basics of dimensional modeling (facts, dimensions, grain)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with Git and working through pull requests (conventional commits, rebasing, GitHub stacks, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about data quality and ask questions when a number looks off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling sensitive data and take privacy seriously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in online safety, fraud prevention, or trust and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can break a larger problem into smaller pieces and explain your approach clearly in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn quickly and ask for feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: Knowledge of dbt basics (models, tests, refs), the one we value most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: Experience with Airflow or a similar orchestration tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: Knowledge of GDPR and privacy in data work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution towards a Collective Health insurance plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
